d 'QQARDL': module to perform Quantile-on-Quantile ARDL (QQARDL) bounds test, long-run, short-run and error-correction coefficients
d
d    qqardl implements the Quantile-on-Quantile Autoregressive
d Distributed Lag    (QQARDL) approach introduced by Destek,
d Radulescu, Ozkan and Balsalobre-Lorente    (2025) and applied by
d Balci and Dogan (2026).  For every pair of quantiles of the
d dependent and the explanatory variable it builds the quantile
d series (QSER) of Li (2025), estimates the ARDL error-correction
d regression, and reports the Pesaran-Shin-Smith bounds test, the
d long-run, short-run and error-correction coefficients as quantile
d grids and paper-style heatmaps. The quantile series is a Mata
d port of the R package qfa, with a Frisch-Newton interior-point
d quantile regression solver. 
d
d KW: ARDL
d KW: quantile
d KW: autoregressive
d KW: distributed lag
d
d Requires: Stata version 15
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261125
d
d Author:   Merwan Roudane, NA
d Support: email  merwanroudane920@@gmail.com
d
f qqardl.ado
f qqardl.sthlp
f qqardl_methods.sthlp
f qqardl_example.do
